Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:32:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Title screen: play the parks' ride music as a title music
 choice

Adds "Ride music" to Options > Sound > Title screen music (config value title_theme = 5). With it chosen, no title theme plays and ride music on the title screen follows the view the same way it does in game, at the ride music volume.

A title park switch cross-fades the music: the previous park's channels fade out over 1.5 s of real time while the new park's fade in (channels are keyed by ride id, which the next park reuses, so the old ones move to a fading list). A park whose rides play exactly one custom (non-stock) music object treats it as the park's soundtrack on the title screen: one ride plays it centered at the loudest in-view volume whatever the view, and other rides using that object stay silent, so view jumps neither cut nor pan it. Stock ride music stays positional.
